<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr36-dg-catalogue" name="Dwarf Guilds" revision="3" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="dg36-r2-00001" name="Sturdy" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Defense rolls when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00002" name="Enhanced Guarded" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Guarded, they always get +1 to Defense rolls from Guarded (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00003" name="Enhanced Sturdy" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Sturdy, they always get +1 to Defense rolls from Sturdy (instead of only when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00004" name="Fortified" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a min. of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00005" name="Guarded" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Defense rolls when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00006" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed anywhere over 3&quot; away from enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00007" name="Melee Slayer" hidden="false"><description>When charging, this model's weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00008" name="Mend" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly model within 3&quot; with Tough, and remove D3 wounds from it.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-00009" name="Precision Frenzy" hidden="false"><description>Place one token on this unit when it fully destroys an enemy unit, up to a max. of two tokens. For each token all models with this rule in this unit get +1 to hit rolls until the end of the game.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000a" name="Scourge" hidden="false"><description>For each unmodified result of 1 to block hits, enemies count as having taken 2 extra wounds when checking who won melee, or if shooting wounds would trigger Morale Tests.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000b" name="Speed Debuff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy model within 18&quot; in line of sight, which moves -2&quot; when using Advance actions and -4&quot; when using Rush/Charge actions once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000c" name="Swift" hidden="false"><description>This model may ignore the Slow rule.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000d" name="Unique Hero" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000e" name="Unpredictable" hidden="false"><description>When attacking, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000f" name="Unpredictable Fighter" hidden="false"><description>When in melee, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000g" name="Unwieldy" hidden="false"><description>Strikes last when charging.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000h" name="Anti-Cover when Shooting Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Anti-Cover on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000i" name="Enhanced Sturdy Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Sturdy.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000j" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000k" name="Infiltrate Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Infiltrate.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000l" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000m" name="Stealth Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Stealth.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000n" name="Swift Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Swift.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000o" name="Unpredictable Fighter Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Unpredictable Fighter.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000p" name="Deceleration Rune (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which moves -2&quot; when using Advance actions and -4&quot; when using Rush/Charge actions once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000q" name="Cleaving Rune (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 1 hit with Blast(3).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000r" name="Battle Rune (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two friendly units within 12&quot;, which get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000s" name="Smiting Rune (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12&quot; in line of sight, which takes 4 hits with Scourge.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000t" name="Armor Rune (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Enhanced Sturdy once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000u" name="Breaking Rune (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 24&quot; in line of sight, which takes 3 hits with AP(4). This effect is resolved as if the target was a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000v" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000w" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000x" name="Anti-Regen" hidden="false"><description>This weapon ignores Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="dg36-r2-0000y" name="Anti-Cover when Shooting" hidden="false"><description>This model gets Anti-Cover on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-dg-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="dg36-r2-003lm" name="Spell Catalogue" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-003ln" name="Deceleration Rune (1)" targetId="dg36-r2-0000p" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-003lo" name="Cleaving Rune (1)" targetId="dg36-r2-0000q" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-003lp" name="Battle Rune (2)" targetId="dg36-r2-0000r" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-003lq" name="Smiting Rune (2)" targetId="dg36-r2-0000s" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-003lr" name="Armor Rune (3)" targetId="dg36-r2-0000t" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-003ls" name="Breaking Rune (3)" targetId="dg36-r2-0000u" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="dg36-r2-003lt" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="dg36-r2-003lu" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-0003d" name="Powersuit Champion" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="dg36-r2-00038" name="Heroes" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="dg36-r2-00039" name="Powersuit Champion" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Hero, Slow, Sturdy, Tough(6)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0003a" name="Hero" targetId="opr-core-hero" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0003b" name="Slow" targetId="opr-core-slow" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0003c" name="Sturdy" targetId="dg36-r2-00001" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-00037" name="Model 1" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="dg36-r2-00035" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="dg36-r2-00036" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="dg36-r2-0002l" name="Upgrade with one role" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="dg36-r2-0002m" type="min" value="0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="dg36-r2-0002n" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-0002g" name="Guild Lord" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0002o" name="Enhanced Sturdy Aura" targetId="dg36-r2-0000i" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="5"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-0002h" name="Forge Master" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0002p" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" targetId="dg36-r2-0000j" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="10"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-0002i" name="Foreman" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0002q" name="Swift Aura" targetId="dg36-r2-0000n" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="25"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-0002j" name="Rune Master" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0002r" name="Caster(2)" targetId="opr-core-caster" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="25"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="dg36-r2-0002k" name="Runesmith" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="dg36-r2-0002s" name="Stealth Aura" targetId="dg36-r2-0000m" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="30"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="dg36-r2-00027" name="Replace Rune Staff" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="dg36-r2-00024"><constraints><constraint id="dg36-r2-00028" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="dg36-r2-00029" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></cons